content:
Let me check what files exist in the repository:

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "list_files",
  "arguments": {
    "pattern": "django/contrib/postgres/aggregates/*.py"
  },
  "reason": "Check available files in the aggregates directory"
}
```

Let me check the broader directory structure:

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "list_files",
  "arguments": {
    "pattern": "django/**/aggregates.py"
  },
  "reason": "Find aggregates files in the repository"
}
```

Let me check the actual file structure:

```json
{
  "type": "tool",
  "tool": "list_files",
  "arguments": {
    "pattern": "**/*.py",
    "limit": 50
  },
  "reason": "Get overview of Python files in repository"
}
```
